  m_Name: EntryDialogue_Phase2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueSO
  localizations:
  - language: 1
    lines:
    - "Vamos, cadete, centraliza a\xED que aqui n\xE3o \xE9 a casa da m\xE3e Joana,
      n\xE3o, hein?!"
    - "Agora que j\xE1 ta sabendo sapatear, vamos dificultar as coisas..."
    - Vou botar um desses patetas para correr, se segura, cadete!
  - language: 0
    lines:
    - Come on, cadet, get your act together, this isn't some free-for-all, okay?!
    - Now that you know how to tap dance, let's make things a little harder...
    - I'm going to have one of those goofballs run. Hang on tight, cadet!
